6.2     Model Construction
6.2.1    Parameter Introduction
    In this multi-objective optimization model, the focus is on five parameters: equipment cost, annual
maintenance cost, availability, usage, and readiness. Below is the definition of each parameter and an
introduction to their calculation methods.




                                                                                型
      • Equipment Cost (C):




                                                                模
   Reflects the initial investment required to purchase various search equipment.




                                                               学
      • Annual Maintenance Cost (M):

   Represents the annual expense required to ensure that the equipment maintains optimal working




                                                       数
conditions within the specified service life.

      • Availability (A):
                                         ：

                                                                     els
   Considers factors such as water temperature, depth, currents, noise, and interference to quantify the
equipment’s operational performance under various conditions.
                                        号

                                                                   od
Calculation of Availability:
                                  众

   The calculation principles for coefficients reflecting the impact of various environmental factors on
sound wave propagation can be summarized into a unified equation as Equation 19.
