           信




Depth Coefficient (𝑊 𝐷𝐶), Water Current Coefficient (𝑊𝐶𝐶), Noise Coefficient (𝑁𝐶), or Interference
Coefficient (𝐼𝐶), depending on the specific application context and metric being measured.
          微




    Range denotes the working range of the environmental variable (water temperature, water depth, water
                                           M



current, noise, or interference). This reflects the product’s adaptability or performance variation range
under different conditions.
                                   ：




